# Keeping the build context small matters here: everything listed below would
# otherwise be uploaded to the daemon on every build and, worse, node_modules
# built on a developer machine would shadow the ones installed in the image.

.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.DS_Store

**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*

sm_backend/uploads
sm_backend/engine
sm_frontend

*.obj
*.step
*.stp
*.iges
*.igs
*.log

README.md
docs
